{"id":"eaa726ab7642c8a5","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-poly-reduction-transitive.md","title":"Transitivity of Polynomial Reductions","display":"thm-poly-reduction-transitive — Transitivity of Polynomial Reductions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-poly-reduction-transitive","aliases":["28-thm-poly-reduction-transitive","Transitivity of Polynomial Reductions"],"display":"thm-poly-reduction-transitive — Transitivity of Polynomial Reductions","depends_on":["[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-poly-reduction-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-poly-reduction-transitive</span><span>Transitivity of Polynomial Reductions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-poly-reduction-transitive — Transitivity of Polynomial Reductions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(A,B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见对应定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}B\\land B\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}C)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}B\\land B\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}C)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> 分别见证两次归约，则复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\circ f\">\\(g\\circ f\\)</span> 保持成员资格。第一函数的输出长度受其运行时间的多项式界限制，把该长度代入第二函数的多项式时间界仍得多项式，故复合属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.8(1)及证明；印刷43页；PDF69页。复合时间和成员资格推导已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"(A\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}B\\land B\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}C)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}C.","display":true},{"tex":"f,g","display":false},{"tex":"g\\circ f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false}],"bytes":1075,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"归约：[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]、[[28-df-poly-reduction]]、[[28-thm-poly-reduction-transitive]]、[[28-df-np-hard]]、[[28-df-np-complete